Date: Tue, 07 Aug 2012 23:59:01 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] changed Stan interval syntax
Message-ID: <z3XKGrDy3Gc.-LIoP5UTX88J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <z3XKGrDy3Gc.l8YQ9rIgEhcJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <z3XKGrDy3Gc.LgNFtD-VJ-sJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <z3XKGrDy3Gc.l8YQ9rIgEhcJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
