The only thing is, there are some problems because I was getting "404 Not Found" errors.  I just ignored the errors and Stan ran just fine, but I could see that this sort of error message could bother people.
Below is the story.
A

I went to the webpage:
http://code.google.com/p/stan/wiki/RStanGettingStarted
and I followed the instructions.  It all went well until this:

