You can just add a flag to stan that
has something like "compile=true" as
a defualt.

Or, you could try to set up make-like
behavior that checks the time stamps on
the file and only recompiles if the
source file is newer than the compiled file.
I wrote this, but there's probably a better
way to do it:

   time.of.file = function(file) {
     return(file.info <http://file.info>(file)$"ctime");
   }

   more.recently.modified = function(file1, file2) {
     return(time.of.file(file1) > time.of.file(file2));
   }

- Bob

