On Thursday, August 9, 2012 4:18:02 PM UTC-4, Bob Carpenter wrote:
> Does anyone know how to make the calls to run Stan parallel
> under R?

In general, the R code would have to distinguish between !Windows and Windows, which is to say POSIX and !POSIX. If you call the compiled code via system(), there is a "wait" argument that defaults to TRUE but can be set to FALSE to async to system call. Conceivably, you could do multiple system calls that way and sleep() until they were done.

Ben

